# Camera

Production cameras are **PoE IP** (RTSP; ONVIF where supported). Laptop webcams are `[MOCK / SYNTHETIC]` only.

Isolate vendors behind adapters (identity, secret-ref stream, health). Do not assume central cloud inference. Dropouts must surface as camera unavailable.

Never commit camera passwords. Browser protocol is **NOT DECIDED** — see `docs/CAMERA-ARCHITECTURE.md`.
